    <rdfs:label>runtime</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">SBOM generated through instrumenting the system running the software, to capture only components present in the system, as well as external call-outs or dynamically loaded components. In some contexts, this may also be referred to as an "Instrumented" or "Dynamic" SBOM.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:NamedIndividual>
  <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Dataset/DatasetType/structured">
